<QuestionLayout
  title="Can different operating systems see different behavior from the same capability?"
  description="Not from the capability's own sandboxed logic. The only legitimate source of difference is a host-implemented call the contract declares — and that dependency is visible in the contract, not hidden inside the capability."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/do-different-operating-systems-see-different-behavior-from-the-same-capability.html"
